WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.479 --> 00:00:05.916
[FOOTSTEPS]

00:00:05.916 --> 00:00:10.353
♪♪

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:27.900
Now we come to the end.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:35.008
There's no way to pretend.

00:00:35.008 --> 00:00:42.070
I can't do this anymore.

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:46.510
It's over, it's over, and done.

00:00:49.430 --> 00:01:01.370
I gave all that I have through the good times and bad.

00:01:03.935 --> 00:01:14.200
You don't want to say goodbye, but it's over, it's over,

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:16.570
and done.

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:23.760
I know that sometimes what we had it was good.

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:31.170
Sometimes life plays out just away then it should for us.

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:36.290
I swear I thought it could for us.

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:41.806
But I'm done holding your hand.

00:01:41.806 --> 00:01:43.630
Holding your--

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:48.740
I pray you understand.

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:50.712
You understand.

00:01:50.712 --> 00:02:01.400
No one wants to face the truth, but it's over, it's over,

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:06.012
it's over, it's over.

00:02:06.012 --> 00:02:11.928
And now--

00:02:11.928 --> 00:02:14.886
We come to the end.

00:02:14.886 --> 00:02:18.337
Now we come to the end.

00:02:18.337 --> 00:02:22.036
There's no way, no way, no way.

00:02:22.036 --> 00:02:28.681
I know that we tried, we swallowed our pride.

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:29.431
Swallow our pride.

00:02:29.431 --> 00:02:31.896
We've gone deep inside.

00:02:31.896 --> 00:02:32.882
Gone deep inside.

00:02:32.882 --> 00:02:38.700
We know that something has died.

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:52.130
It's over, it's over, it's over, it's over and done.

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:55.602
Over and done.

00:02:55.602 --> 00:02:57.586
It's over and over and done.

00:03:03.042 --> 00:03:09.080
It's over and done.

